{
  "id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/evento-ambiente/ambiente-de-cordon-litoral",
  "type": "Concept",
  "prefLabel": {
    "en": "strandplain setting",
    "es": "ambiente de cordon litoral"
  },
  "definition": {
    "en": "A prograded shore built seaward by waves and currents, and continuous for some distance along the coast. It is characterized by subparallel beach ridges and swales, in places with associated dunes.",
    "es": "Litoral progradante construido mar adentro por el oleaje y las corrientes, y que continua durante alguna distancia a lo largo de la costa. Se caracteriza por los cordones y surcos de playa subparalelos, en lugares con dunas asociadas."
  },
